I used the illustration last week about Nebuchadnezzar.

00:25:32.980 --> 00:25:34.380
I've heard people preach sermons

00:25:34.380 --> 00:25:36.660
that Nebuchadnezzar was saved and then I heard people

00:25:36.660 --> 00:25:39.100
preach sermons that say that Nebuchadnezzar was lost.

00:25:39.100 --> 00:25:40.620
And you say, pastor, what do you think?

00:25:40.620 --> 00:25:42.900
I don't think the man was saved but if you do,

00:25:42.900 --> 00:25:45.340
I'm not gonna separate from you.

00:25:45.340 --> 00:25:46.660
Does that make sense?

00:25:46.660 --> 00:25:49.060
And I can look at some verses and I can tell you

00:25:49.060 --> 00:25:52.440
how I reached the position that I did

00:25:52.440 --> 00:25:54.580
but if you look and say, well, I really think this

00:25:54.580 --> 00:25:55.780
and when he made this declaration,

00:25:55.780 --> 00:25:58.820
I'm not mad at you, I'm not gonna fight with you over it.

00:25:58.820 --> 00:26:02.660
There are some things that we will have division over.

00:26:02.660 --> 00:26:05.740
Jesus is God, we're not gonna agree

00:26:05.740 --> 00:26:07.460
to disagree on that one.

00:26:07.460 --> 00:26:09.620
And so you understand that there's some doctrinal things

00:26:09.620 --> 00:26:12.340
but what I'm saying when I talk about a proper position

00:26:12.340 --> 00:26:17.100
is that we can have the conversation

00:26:17.100 --> 00:26:20.820
and we can demonstrate through a proper

00:26:20.820 --> 00:26:25.180
hermeneutical structure, exegeting the word of God

00:26:25.180 --> 00:26:27.920
and show somebody here's the position.

00:26:29.040 --> 00:26:32.340
You may not come, I may not be able to persuade you

00:26:32.340 --> 00:26:35.860
of the position but I ought to be able to demonstrate

00:26:35.860 --> 00:26:39.680
for you that this is our position and this is why.

00:26:39.680 --> 00:26:41.680
Does that make sense this evening?

00:26:41.680 --> 00:26:44.320
And so we wanna have that proper position

00:26:44.320 --> 00:26:46.200
but as much as we wanna have the proper position,

00:26:46.200 --> 00:26:48.840
it's important that we have the proper disposition.

00:26:50.720 --> 00:26:52.320
Now, what's the disposition?

00:26:52.320 --> 00:26:54.560
You know, some people can give truth

00:26:54.560 --> 00:26:56.160
and be really ugly about it.

00:26:57.140 --> 00:26:59.960
I mean, the message they're speaking is true

00:26:59.960 --> 00:27:04.200
but they're just ugly about it, mean, critical.

00:27:05.720 --> 00:27:09.760
And that's not how God has given us the instruction

00:27:09.760 --> 00:27:13.040
in his word with regard to seeing,

00:27:13.040 --> 00:27:15.980
you think about Paul, he cared for them as a nurse,

00:27:15.980 --> 00:27:18.200
cherished with her children in Thessalonica.

00:27:18.200 --> 00:27:20.600
That's somebody that's coming in and ministering

00:27:20.600 --> 00:27:24.080
and speaking truth, having the right position

00:27:24.080 --> 00:27:26.940
but also having the right disposition.

00:27:26.940 --> 00:27:29.160
There's a lot of things going on in our world today.

00:27:29.160 --> 00:27:32.240
There's a lot of things that we're against biblically

00:27:32.240 --> 00:27:35.520
and we should be, we gotta have the right position.

00:27:35.520 --> 00:27:38.960
Gender, there's man and woman, period.

00:27:39.960 --> 00:27:41.120
But you know, there's a lot of people

00:27:41.120 --> 00:27:43.760
that are really blinded,

00:27:45.020 --> 00:27:47.160
that have been deceived by the enemy

00:27:48.080 --> 00:27:52.280
and if I'm ugly about it and I'm beating them up about it,

00:27:52.280 --> 00:27:55.200
how likely are they to really kind of even listen to me?

00:27:56.040 --> 00:27:57.900
You understand what I'm saying this evening?

00:27:57.900 --> 00:28:01.560
I'm not saying compromise, I'm just simply saying

00:28:01.560 --> 00:28:03.680
as we read in Ephesians four and verse 15,

00:28:03.680 --> 00:28:06.240
speak the truth in love.

00:28:07.240 --> 00:28:10.680
And so we find this evening that there are things

00:28:10.680 --> 00:28:13.200
that we absolutely must stand for

00:28:13.200 --> 00:28:15.280
and we must have that right position

00:28:15.280 --> 00:28:17.400
but then we have the right disposition.

00:28:17.400 --> 00:28:18.720
I shared with somebody on Sunday night,

00:28:18.720 --> 00:28:21.080
they asked me a quick question and I gave them an answer

00:28:21.080 --> 00:28:22.480
and I said this, I said listen,

00:28:22.480 --> 00:28:24.960
we have to deal with people as individuals.

00:28:27.040 --> 00:28:28.400
What do I mean by that?

00:28:28.400 --> 00:28:31.320
I don't wanna have a conversation with somebody

00:28:31.320 --> 00:28:33.680
and assume that they have certain beliefs

00:28:33.680 --> 00:28:35.360
because of something they said

00:28:35.360 --> 00:28:36.920
that would maybe tie them

00:28:36.920 --> 00:28:39.080
to a particular religion or organization.

00:28:39.080 --> 00:28:42.600
No, I wanna deal with them as an individual.

00:28:42.600 --> 00:28:45.280
And by the way, if you talk to a Catholic

00:28:45.280 --> 00:28:49.780
and all you wanna do is bash Catholicism, good luck.

00:28:51.460 --> 00:28:54.840
I'm not for Catholicism but I have to understand

00:28:54.840 --> 00:28:58.880
that the individual that I'm speaking to

00:28:58.880 --> 00:29:01.860
may not even really know what Catholicism teaches.

00:29:02.700 --> 00:29:04.720
They may have no idea.

00:29:05.820 --> 00:29:07.740
And so here I am attacking,

00:29:07.740 --> 00:29:10.400
how likely are you to listen to somebody

00:29:10.400 --> 00:29:11.660
that's just attacking you?

00:29:12.720 --> 00:29:14.740
Right, you know what I mean?

00:29:14.740 --> 00:29:17.340
Like I turn them off, tune them out,

00:29:17.340 --> 00:29:20.220
like when are we done, right?

00:29:20.220 --> 00:29:22.540
Body language, can you read body language?

00:29:22.540 --> 00:29:24.740
Some people can read it good, some people can't.

00:29:24.740 --> 00:29:26.940
You know, people can give you those little signals

00:29:26.940 --> 00:29:28.340
like I'm done talking to you.

00:29:29.260 --> 00:29:31.260
Right, you know what I'm talking about?

00:29:31.940 --> 00:29:33.460
And what I'm saying to you this evening

00:29:33.460 --> 00:29:35.500
is that we gotta have the right position

00:29:35.500 --> 00:29:37.860
but we gotta have the right disposition.

00:29:37.860 --> 00:29:39.900
When we're gonna stand for truth

00:29:40.980 --> 00:29:42.540
and we must stand for truth

00:29:43.500 --> 00:29:47.100
but it's important that we have the right disposition.

00:29:47.100 --> 00:29:48.500
So when we look at this whole thing

00:29:48.500 --> 00:29:51.020
and we, knowing the truth and we say,

00:29:51.020 --> 00:29:53.059
man, I have desire, I wanna know truth.

00:29:53.059 --> 00:29:54.780
Well, if you wanna know truth,

00:29:54.780 --> 00:29:56.220
you gotta have that commitment

00:29:56.220 --> 00:29:58.059
that David had in Psalm 8611,

00:29:58.059 --> 00:29:59.940
teach me thy way, O Lord,

00:29:59.940 --> 00:30:00.780
I will walk.

00:30:00.780 --> 00:30:02.880
walk in thy truth.

00:30:02.880 --> 00:30:04.720
It's like the little song that we sang on Sunday morning

00:30:04.720 --> 00:30:06.560
in Sunday school, I'll say yes, Lord, yes,

00:30:06.560 --> 00:30:08.420
to your will and to your way.

00:30:08.420 --> 00:30:10.760
I'll say yes, Lord, yes, I'll trust you and obey.

00:30:10.760 --> 00:30:13.520
When your spirit speaks to me with my whole heart,

00:30:13.520 --> 00:30:17.300
I'll agree, and my answer will be yes, Lord, yes.

00:30:17.300 --> 00:30:19.760
And the idea of that third little verse there,

00:30:19.760 --> 00:30:22.680
when your spirit speaks to me, I say this

00:30:22.680 --> 00:30:24.520
and I understand this to be the truth,

00:30:24.520 --> 00:30:26.920
is that every time God's word is open,

00:30:26.920 --> 00:30:28.480
the spirit wants to speak.

00:30:28.600 --> 00:30:29.860
Amen.

00:30:29.860 --> 00:30:32.320
Because the spirit of God uses the word of God

00:30:32.320 --> 00:30:35.280
in the heart of the people of God.

00:30:35.280 --> 00:30:38.380
And so the spirit of God wants to speak.

00:30:38.380 --> 00:30:41.800
So when your spirit speaks to me with my whole heart,

00:30:41.800 --> 00:30:44.980
I'll agree, but you know, it is altogether possible

00:30:44.980 --> 00:30:48.320
for you to be here tonight and be completely distracted

00:30:48.320 --> 00:30:49.940
that you didn't get one thing of anything

00:30:49.940 --> 00:30:51.480
that's taken place tonight.

00:30:51.480 --> 00:30:52.800
Maybe you heard about the rattlesnake

00:30:52.800 --> 00:30:53.720
because people were laughing,

00:30:53.720 --> 00:30:55.560
but you understand we get distracted.

00:30:56.720 --> 00:30:58.080
How many times have you read your Bible

00:30:58.720 --> 00:30:59.560
and you're getting through reading and you're like,

00:30:59.560 --> 00:31:01.840
you know what, I don't even know what I just read.

00:31:01.840 --> 00:31:03.320
I checked the box.

00:31:03.320 --> 00:31:05.520
I read today, but if someone were to ask you

00:31:05.520 --> 00:31:06.760
five minutes later, what'd you read?

00:31:06.760 --> 00:31:08.120
You're like, I got nothing.

00:31:09.920 --> 00:31:12.200
It happened to me two weeks ago.

00:31:12.200 --> 00:31:13.360
I was reading.

00:31:13.360 --> 00:31:14.720
Listen, we're humans, man.

00:31:14.720 --> 00:31:16.120
We get distracted by things.

00:31:16.120 --> 00:31:18.600
We got things on our heart, things on our mind.

00:31:20.440 --> 00:31:25.440
And I was reading my Bible, quiet, nobody around,

00:31:25.440 --> 00:31:27.400
but my mind was somewhere else.

00:31:28.080 --> 00:31:29.680
Because there were some things going on

00:31:29.680 --> 00:31:31.520
that just had me distracted.

00:31:31.520 --> 00:31:33.600
I'm just being honest tonight.

00:31:33.600 --> 00:31:36.360
About a chapter and a half in, you know what I said?

00:31:36.360 --> 00:31:38.120
God was like, what am I doing, man?

00:31:39.840 --> 00:31:42.360
I don't even, it's just, I was reading it.

00:31:44.080 --> 00:31:45.080
Nothing happening.

00:31:47.040 --> 00:31:48.800
I took a moment to pray.

00:31:48.800 --> 00:31:51.640
Lord, help me to be focused,

00:31:51.640 --> 00:31:53.680
to eliminate these distractions.

00:31:53.680 --> 00:31:54.560
It wasn't distraction.

00:31:54.560 --> 00:31:56.240
You know what, I actually do pretty good

00:31:56.240 --> 00:31:58.840
with distractions that are external.

00:31:58.840 --> 00:32:00.560
Like, I can keep on going, and man,

00:32:00.560 --> 00:32:03.320
something happens back there, people, I'm just rolling.

00:32:04.320 --> 00:32:06.320
But sometimes there's some things that people tell you

00:32:06.320 --> 00:32:09.880
that are just heavy things, and they're just on your heart.

00:32:10.760 --> 00:32:11.640
Do you know what I'm saying?

00:32:11.640 --> 00:32:13.280
You know what I'm talking about?

00:32:13.280 --> 00:32:14.800
And you can be distracted.

00:32:15.880 --> 00:32:17.480
Lord, help me.

00:32:17.480 --> 00:32:18.320
You know what I did?

00:32:18.320 --> 00:32:19.560
I went back and started back over

00:32:19.560 --> 00:32:21.120
where I had started originally.

00:32:21.120 --> 00:32:21.960
Why?

00:32:21.960 --> 00:32:24.400
Because I believe that God had something for me,

00:32:24.400 --> 00:32:28.360
but I wasn't getting it because I wasn't there.

00:32:28.360 --> 00:32:30.360
I mean, I was there, but I wasn't there.

00:32:31.440 --> 00:32:33.800
We can do that in church.

00:32:33.800 --> 00:32:35.480
You can do that with your spouse.

00:32:37.720 --> 00:32:42.120
I told you, I remember having the conversation,

00:32:42.120 --> 00:32:45.400
but are we relating this evening?

00:32:45.400 --> 00:32:47.000
Are we getting it right?

00:32:47.000 --> 00:32:49.800
Here's what they said to Jeremiah.

00:32:49.800 --> 00:32:53.040
Jeremiah, go pray for us.

00:32:53.040 --> 00:32:56.360
And whatever God tells you, we're gonna do it.

00:32:58.320 --> 00:33:00.040
Jeremiah goes and prays.

00:33:00.040 --> 00:33:01.880
Jeremiah comes back and says, here's what God said,

00:33:01.880 --> 00:33:04.120
and they said, nah, we're not gonna do that.

00:33:05.580 --> 00:33:07.720
So that's another possibility.

00:33:07.720 --> 00:33:09.720
We say, I wanna know truth, and then God gives us truth,

00:33:09.720 --> 00:33:13.120
and we say, nah, I'm not really interested

00:33:13.120 --> 00:33:14.440
in going that far.

00:33:15.720 --> 00:33:18.520
I'm not gonna be that committed.

00:33:18.520 --> 00:33:20.220
Do you understand what I'm saying?

00:33:21.180 --> 00:33:23.640
And so this evening, we say, I wanna know truth,

00:33:23.640 --> 00:33:24.820
but then I have to make the commitment

00:33:24.820 --> 00:33:26.940
that I'm gonna walk in truth.

00:33:26.940 --> 00:33:28.740
And as I'm walking in truth, I'm saying,

00:33:28.740 --> 00:33:30.620
listen, I'm gonna stand for truth.

00:33:31.660 --> 00:33:34.840
I understand that not everyone's gonna agree with me,

00:33:34.840 --> 00:33:36.940
that not everyone's gonna have the same position

00:33:36.940 --> 00:33:38.800
that I have, but I wanna be able to have

00:33:38.800 --> 00:33:41.780
the right disposition so that I can sit down

00:33:41.780 --> 00:33:45.040
and speak the truth in love and be able to have

00:33:45.040 --> 00:33:49.440
an open Bible and show them, here's where we've reached how,

00:33:49.440 --> 00:33:52.320
we've reached our conclusion, here's the scripture.

00:33:54.040 --> 00:33:58.360
And then God can use his word to do something

00:33:58.360 --> 00:34:03.120
in the heart of that individual that I could never do,

00:34:03.120 --> 00:34:04.920
that you could never do.

00:34:04.920 --> 00:34:07.280
And let me say this in closing tonight.

00:34:09.880 --> 00:34:14.880
You, no matter how long you've been saved,

00:34:15.240 --> 00:34:19.920
you have not always believed like you believe

00:34:19.920 --> 00:34:20.760
at this moment.

00:34:22.200 --> 00:34:23.920
Here's what I mean by that.

00:34:23.920 --> 00:34:26.840
The night I got saved, if somebody told me

00:34:26.840 --> 00:34:29.560
imputed righteousness, I went to public school,

00:34:29.560 --> 00:34:31.360
I didn't even know the word imputed.

00:34:32.920 --> 00:34:34.800
Just being honest.

00:34:34.800 --> 00:34:37.040
If someone were to ask me that night that I got saved,

00:34:37.040 --> 00:34:38.360
hey, what do you think about tongues?

00:34:38.360 --> 00:34:39.360
Is it for today or not?

00:34:39.360 --> 00:34:41.240
I'd have thought they were talking about my physical tongue.

00:34:41.240 --> 00:34:43.360
I had no idea about tongues.

00:34:44.200 --> 00:34:46.840
Are we tracking this evening?

00:34:46.840 --> 00:34:50.380
So somebody came along in my life and someone came along

00:34:50.380 --> 00:34:53.160
in your life and spoke the truth in love

00:34:54.080 --> 00:34:56.160
and they weren't ugly and they weren't nasty

00:34:56.160 --> 00:35:00.240
and they just brought you along and they gave you truth.

00:35:01.160 --> 00:35:03.480
Because you wanted to know truth.

00:35:03.480 --> 00:35:06.000
You had a desire to know it.

00:35:06.000 --> 00:35:08.920
And you had a commitment to walk in truth.

00:35:08.920 --> 00:35:10.840
And now we're standing for truth.

00:35:10.840 --> 00:35:13.120
And sometimes if we're not careful,

00:35:13.880 --> 00:35:16.600
we see people that maybe don't have the same position

00:35:16.600 --> 00:35:20.000
that we have and we can look down on them.

00:35:20.880 --> 00:35:23.660
We can be critical of them.

00:35:23.660 --> 00:35:25.460
They don't have our same standard.

00:35:25.460 --> 00:35:28.260
They don't have our same, just go through the list.

00:35:29.540 --> 00:35:31.260
That guy just got saved.

00:35:32.640 --> 00:35:33.880
I mean, do you know that,

00:35:34.840 --> 00:35:37.260
and sometimes it's good for us to just go back

00:35:37.260 --> 00:35:42.260
where we started and how it took us to get to where we are

00:35:43.320 --> 00:35:44.720
so you know what?

00:35:44.720 --> 00:35:46.880
I'm thankful for those people that were gracious

00:35:46.880 --> 00:35:48.280
and patient.

00:35:49.240 --> 00:35:53.560
I'm thankful for those that wanted to invest in.

00:35:53.560 --> 00:35:54.440
They stood for truth.

00:35:54.440 --> 00:35:56.300
They never compromised.

00:35:56.300 --> 00:35:58.360
They were patient in teaching.

00:35:59.820 --> 00:36:00.660
Why?

00:36:00.660 --> 00:36:02.280
So that we could know truth.

00:36:02.280 --> 00:36:05.580
So this evening, the psalmist that I have chosen,

00:36:06.880 --> 00:36:11.100
make that choice that we're gonna walk in God's way,

00:36:11.100 --> 00:36:15.220
in God's truth, that we're gonna live for him.

00:36:15.220 --> 00:36:16.060
Let's pray.

00:36:16.060 --> 00:36:17.340
Father, we love you.

00:36:17.340 --> 00:36:18.780
We thank you so much for loving us.

00:36:18.780 --> 00:36:22.500
We thank you for the privilege of knowing truth.

00:36:26.060 --> 00:36:28.700
Not how much we know of your word is

00:36:31.020 --> 00:36:33.700
really our own decision.

00:36:35.300 --> 00:36:36.900
How committed are we?

00:36:36.900 --> 00:36:39.940
How disciplined and diligent are we?

00:36:39.940 --> 00:36:42.960
How much desire do we have to know truth?

00:36:44.380 --> 00:36:46.700
And God, I pray that we would have the heart

00:36:46.700 --> 00:36:50.620
of the psalmist teach me thy way, oh Lord.

00:36:50.620 --> 00:36:52.100
I will walk in thy truth.

00:36:52.100 --> 00:36:54.620
Lord, help us to walk in truth.

00:36:54.620 --> 00:36:57.400
Then God, help us to stand for truth.

00:36:58.980 --> 00:37:01.540
The right position, but also the right disposition.

00:37:01.540 --> 00:37:05.940
Lord, help us to deal with people as individuals,

00:37:05.940 --> 00:37:08.700
understanding that you died for them and you love them,

00:37:09.540 --> 00:37:12.100
and that there's a spiritual battle that's raging

00:37:12.100 --> 00:37:17.100
and the enemy has blinded their eyes to the truth.

00:37:19.980 --> 00:37:21.460
God, you've given us the opportunity,

00:37:21.460 --> 00:37:23.580
the privilege to preach, to proclaim truth,

00:37:23.580 --> 00:37:28.300
and I pray that you'd help us to do it in love.

00:37:28.300 --> 00:37:29.620
Thank you for the privilege of prayer.

00:37:29.620 --> 00:37:31.460
I pray that you'd bless our time.

00:37:31.460 --> 00:37:33.820
We thank you that you hear and answer prayer.

00:37:33.820 --> 00:37:35.180
Thank you that you're able.

00:37:36.140 --> 00:37:38.780
It's in Christ's name we pray, amen.

00:37:38.780 --> 00:37:40.140
All right, so on the back.

